{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50836","headline":"僊桥 · 缪岛云","name":"僊桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千丈侧悬飞鸟外，双峯横架碧天心。\n月中才有僊人过，山下应闻笙磬音。\n丹竃路穿瑶草湿，朱砂泉迸锦霞深。\n轩辕去後虽然在，争奈凡流无处寻。\n（以上十首均见康熙十八年闵麟嗣撰《黄山志定本》卷六。\n）（〖1〗缪岛云逸诗承仪徵吴白匋先生见告。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缪岛云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}